kávy v Jeseníku.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "63c1152", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "aa9331e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "02", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6963411", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Nabídka zdarma", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ec1a4d1", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Dostanete jasnou cenu, rozsah a termín. Bez skrytých položek.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "2deb187", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8eaa7d4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "03", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "0fa53c4", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Struktura webu", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1c0ebb9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Navrhneme, jaké stránky web potřebuje a jak po nich návštěvník dojde k poptávce.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "58c88ef", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b1cadb2", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "04", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4c27c0a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Obsah", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a8a8d98", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pomůžeme s texty, které prodávají a zároveň dobře fungují ve vyhledávačích.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "a65ade4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "102aa82", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "05", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e0bb9ea", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Design", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a41cb66", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Grafický návrh v duchu vaší značky. Připomínkujete, dokud nejste spokojení.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "552a785", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "43a4a95", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "06", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c8ae1eb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Realizace", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e281753", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web postavíme na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "c2a04c6", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "0d51bba", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "07", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9d562ff", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "3603589", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Doména, hosting, SSL, Analytics, Search Console a kontrola všech formulářů.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "7e770ad", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-card ww-mustcard ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5668b44", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "08", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "aa91d54", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Péče po spuštění", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "79649bd", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Aktualizace, zálohy, úpravy a další rozvoj webu podle výsledků.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-musttext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "fa47c10", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "detail"}, "elements": [{"id": "3fcbe10", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-legal-wrap ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "47ba074", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Proč tvorba webu na míru místo šablony", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "98c18db", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Web z online stavebnice vypadá podobně jako tisíce dalších a často naráží na limity – v SEO, ve vlastnictví dat i v možnostech dalšího rozvoje. Tvorba webu na míru znamená, že strukturu, texty i design přizpůsobíme vašemu oboru a zákazníkům.</p><h3>Web, který si upravíte sami</h3><p>Stavíme převážně na WordPressu a Elementoru. Texty, fotky, ceník nebo novou stránku změníte sami bez programátora. Ukážeme vám, jak na to, a když budete chtít, úpravy převezmeme.</p><h3>SEO od prvního dne</h3><p>Každá stránka má promyšlené nadpisy, popisky, interní odkazy a strukturovaná data. Web tak má od začátku šanci ukázat se lidem, kteří hledají vaše služby na Googlu.</p><h3>Pro klienty z celé České republiky</h3><p>Sídlíme v Jeseníku, ale tvorba webových stránek u nás není vázaná na region. Pracujeme pro klienty z Olomouckého, Moravskoslezského i Pardubického kraje a z celého Česka.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-legaltext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "c12d058", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "reference"}, "elements": [{"id": "e9a8070", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b38d70d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "3c14439", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b268cdf", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Reference", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f7936c5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Weby, na které jsme hrdí.", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9b7921e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Výběr realizací. Celé portfolio webů, e-shopů a kampaní najdete na Yesmark.eu.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted ww-lead"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9da4293", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-refs", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a139255", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a979d2b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "b77058a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 28, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-konradt-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Konradt", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7053578", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "626976e", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6016ffa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · CNC obrábění", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8617108", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Konradt", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2bfce22", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro společnost KONRADT jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na profesionální prezentaci služeb v oblasti CNC obrábění, montáže a zpracování kovů. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní technický vzhled, přehledné představení výrobních možností společnosti a srozumitelnou prezentaci jednotlivých služeb.</p><p>Součástí realizace byla také optimalizace struktury a obsahu webu s ohledem na vyhledávače a lepší dohledatelnost služeb v oblasti CNC frézování, CNC soustružení, montážních prací a dodávek odlitků.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "e759d7f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "konradt.cz", "link": {"url": "https://www.konradt.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "967d395", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8fe6d5d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "2515ad6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 29, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-monika-velickova-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Monika Veličková", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "c5c8cab", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "f0a40a2", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "8760323", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Reality Jeseníky", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "4e052ef", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Monika Veličková", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "75fbf4f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Pro realitní makléřku Moniku Veličkovou jsme vytvořili nové webové stránky zaměřené na prezentaci nemovitostí a realitních služeb v Jeseníkách. Při realizaci jsme kladli důraz na moderní a osobitý design, přehlednou prezentaci nabízených nemovitostí a především na budování osobní značky, která staví na znalosti regionu, individuálním přístupu a zkušenostech s realitami i investicemi.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "7d71b38", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "monikavelickova.cz", "link": {"url": "https://monikavelickova.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "496310b", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "4c9260c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-top", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "a5fdd00", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "image", "settings": {"image": {"id": 27, "url": "https://wwwwww.cz/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/reference-brincil-web.jpg", "alt": "Reference: web Břinčil", "source": "library"}, "image_size": "large", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-shot"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5e2fa52", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"ww-ref-hint\">Projeďte web ↓</span>", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-hintw"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "a15159c", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-ref-body", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "5baf86c", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Web · Technika a služby", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-ref-tag"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "f143632", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Břinčil", "header_size": "h3", "_css_classes": "ww-h3"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "744f3e9", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Při realizaci webu pro firmu Břinčil jsme kladli důraz na moderní a přehledný design, snadnou orientaci návštěvníků a kvalitní prezentaci společnosti i její techniky. Nový web zároveň slouží jako podpůrná prezentace hlavní společnosti Břinčil &amp; Míka s.r.o., pro kterou jsme v minulosti rovněž realizovali kompletní online prezentaci.</p>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "a91a5da", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "brincil.cz", "link": {"url": "https://brincil.cz/", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--plain ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "b22f2ae", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row ww-refs-more ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "37ec078", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Další weby, e-shopy a kampaně najdete v portfoliu Yesmark.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "1d2e187", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Všechny reference", "link": {"url": "https://yesmark.eu/reference/?utm_source=wwwwww.cz&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=wwwwww_reference&utm_content=homepage_all", "is_external": "on", "nofollow": ""}, "_css_classes": "ww-btn--dark ww-btn--ext"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "7e556ea", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-dark", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "cenik"}, "elements": [{"id": "d5e3342", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ww-price", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "cb15b20", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-price-card ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "e31b7aa", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Cena", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "bcc1263", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "<small>Tvorba webových stránek</small>od 9 900 Kč", "header_size": "div", "_css_classes": "ww-price-num"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "ed5ad4e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Konečná cena záleží na rozsahu, funkcích a grafice. Nabídku vám připravíme zdarma a nezávazně.</p>", "_css_classes": "ww-muted"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "39a6ca1", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-row", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "6eb61fe", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "settings": {"text": "Chci cenovou nabídku", "link": {"url": "#poptavka", "is_external": "", "nofollow": ""}}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "be0af20", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "391b32a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "settings": {"title": "Časté otázky – tvorba webových stránek", "header_size": "h2", "_css_classes": "ww-h2s"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5b34f56", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "toggle", "settings": {"faq_schema": "yes", "tabs": [{"_id": "229f527", "tab_title": "Kolik stojí tvorba webových stránek?", "tab_content": "<p>Tvorba webových stránek začíná na 9 900 Kč. Cena záleží na počtu stránek, funkcích a grafickém zpracování. Podrobnosti najdete na stránce <a href=\"/kolik-stoji-web/\">Kolik stojí web</a>.</p>"}, {"_id": "3304f09", "tab_title": "Jak dlouho trvá tvorba webu?", "tab_content": "<p>Jednodušší prezentační web bývá hotový za 2–4 týdny, rozsáhlejší web nebo e-shop za 4–8 týdnů. Přesný harmonogram dostanete v nabídce.</p>"}, {"_id": "6f9c4b0", "tab_title": "Co od vás budete potřebovat?", "tab_content": "<p>Hlavně informace o vašich službách, logo a ideálně vlastní fotky. S texty rádi pomůžeme.</p>"}, {"_id": "a009277", "tab_title": "Na jakém systému web postavíte?", "tab_content": "<p>Nejčastěji na WordPressu s Elementorem, u individuálních projektů na October CMS. Web je vždy ve vašem vlastnictví.</p>"}, {"_id": "b307026", "tab_title": "Pomůžete s doménou a hostingem?", "tab_content": "<p>Ano. Doménu i hosting zařídíme, nebo web napojíme na ty, které už máte.</p>"}], "_css_classes": "ww-faq"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}, {"id": "aa0e2e5", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww ww-sec ww-light", "html_tag": "section", "_element_id": "poptavka"}, "elements": [{"id": "3133b2f", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-wrap ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "12750d4", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ww-head ww-rv", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "dd5089d", "elType": "container", "isInner": true, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "css_classes": "ww-c ", "html_tag": "div"}, "elements": [{"id": "66f1220", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "se